  "description": "The PC lens features higher transmittance than other materials,which provides a clearer & brighter lighting so that you can enjoy a pleasant & safe drive.\nFitment\n2006-2013 Chevy Impala\n2014-2016 Chevy Impala Limited\n2006-2007 Chevy Monte Carlo\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 2006-2013 Chevy Impala, 2014-2016 Chevy Impala Limited, 2006-2007 Chevy Monte Carlo. High beam: H11, low beam: H9, bulbs are not included\nEnhanced Visibility & Safety: LED headlights make your vehicle more conspicuous during the day, while the projector lens delivers a stronger, concentrated beam at night. You'll see better and be seen better in all driving conditions\nWaterproof Design: Fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nImpact Resistance: Impact-resistant polycarbonate lens absorbs shocks from gravel and potholes. Reinforced housing dampens vibration for long-lasting structural integrity\nEasy to Install: No modification, no cutting, or no drilling needed. The headlight assembly looks and functions like the stock headlights; professional installation would be highly recommended",
